  m_text: "Developed By\n\uBC15\uC2DC\uC724 Park Si yun : \uD300\uC7A5 Team Leader\n\uC774\uC0C1\uC9C4
    Lee Sang jin\n\uC720\uBC94\uC775 Yu Bum Ik\n\uC815\uD76C\uC12D Jung \n\nAssets
    Used\nUnity Asset Store\n   Survivalist Character : https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/survivalist-character-181470\n  
    RPG/FPS Game Assets for PC/Mobile (Industrial Set v2.0) : https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/industrial/rpg-fps-game-assets-for-pc-mobile-industrial-set-v2-0-86679\n  
